cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Zigong MEDS ETL
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file, and cite the Zigong database itself
  (see references).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Robin
    family-names: van de Water
    email: rpv2114@cumc.columbia.edu
