repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/rvandewater/ZIGONG_MEDS
abstract: >
  A MEDS-Extract powered ETL pipeline that converts the
  Zigong Fourth People's Hospital ICU infection database v1.1
  from PhysioNet into the Medical Event Data Standard (MEDS).
keywords:
  - MEDS
  - ETL
  - electronic health records
  - intensive care
  - Zigong
